cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite the repository."
title: "WDD Playground: git blame for the residual stream"
abstract: "An interactive provenance explorer for GPT-2 small. It shows which neurons, attention heads, token embeddings and sparse-autoencoder features wrote each residual-stream state (Weight-Dictionary Decomposition), checks the answers by exact ablation, steers the model, and follows one write's descendants to the output."
authors:
